  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 11
  storyText: "The sky is gray again. Heavy clouds hanging low like they're trying
    to touch the ground. The ducks are still here, though. Waddling around the courtyard
    like nothing has changed. We watched them for a while this morning. Counting
    them. Nine. Ten. Eleven. The same number as always. No ducks missing. No ducks
    bitten. No ducks turned into zombies. We're not sure why. Maybe zombies don't
    like duck meat. Maybe the ducks are just faster than they look. Or maybe \u2014
    and this is the funny thought \u2014 maybe the ducks are the only ones who figured
    it out. Stay low. Stay together. Don't make noise. We're taking notes. Not that
    it's helping.\r"
